_model: proposition
---
title: Proposition 74
---
order: 74
---
short_label: X.74
---
statement: If from a medial straight line there is subtracted a medial straight line which is commensurable with the whole in square only, and which contains with the whole a rational rectangle, then the remainder is irrational; let it be called <i>first apotome of a medial</i> straight line.
---
proof:

